# Agent hides a harness write in a cat heredoc whose only redirection is
# stderr: the body goes to stdout, so it is no file write; only `cat` with
# exactly one `>`/`>>` to a regular file makes the body data (ADR-0037,
# ADR-0043, ADR-0049; critic finding on 95cc163)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "cat 2> /tmp/e <<EOF\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
